<title>UK: Tunisia tenders to buy one cargo white sugar-trade.</title>
<headline>Tunisia tenders to buy one cargo white sugar-trade.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tunisia tendered on Wednesday to buy one cargo of 45 ICUMSA white sugar for August 1997 shipment, traders said.</p>
<p>The tender closes on Wednesday afternoon.  </p>
<p>The body issuing the tender was the OCT government buying agency, the traders said.</p>
<p>Tunisia last bought sugar on October 30, taking a cargo of 13,000 tonnes of whites for shipment in June 1997 at a snap tender.</p>
<p>Traders said the price was $346.50 a tonne C&amp;F.</p>
<p>-- Jalil Hamid, London newsroom +44 171 542 4985</p>
